 libqt5svg5,
 librsvg2-common,
 xfce4-screenshooter
Description: config files to add a Wayland session to BunsenLabs Linux
 Various configuration files for Wayland on BunsenLabs Linux.
 Contains user config files to be added to an existing BunsenLabs system
 to provide an optional Wayland session at login.
 .
 This experimental package relies on having a BunsenLabs X11 system
 already set up; it adds only the extra configuration needed to enable
 an optional Wayland session, and depends on some extra packages needed.
 .
 Some packages which are Recommends of the regular bunsen-configs
 packages are Depends of this package.
